read:
  B QUAL_missed = catalog SNPs QUAL>59 never called (the gain); foundr_disag = pooled(v3) vs direct(catalog) founder-call disagreement.
  C monomorphic = all founders fixed same allele (catalog drops as non-segregating; useless for haps anyway).
  C segregating = real founder-segregating SNPs the catalog still dropped -> near-indel (snpgap) or measurement; the ones to inspect.
